<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese tax receipts rise Jan-July.</title>
<headline>Portuguese tax receipts rise Jan-July.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese tax receipts rose 11.2 percent to 2,320 billion escudos between January and July compared with the same period last year, the Finance Ministry said.</p>
<p>Despite the increase, the ministry warned that overall tax income for 1997 would only meet budget forecasts if the government's policy of widening the base for taxable income was put into effect efficiently.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
